      "note": "Archaeology (1996): two charcoal samples ca. A.D. 1070. World History Encyclopedia: either c. 320 BCE or c. 1000-1750 CE. History.com: a 2014 study gave 381 to 44 B.C. (mean 321 B.C.). Date and culture contested."
